        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 2256, 3 Inch Magnetic Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Emtek 2256 Magnetic Door Stop and Holder is made up of a 3 inch long base section--which has a permanent magnet on the end--and the receptor is screwed onto the door. The 3 Inch Magnetic Door Stop can be mounted to the floor, the wall, or the baseboard.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-2256-specifications.gif?v=1704354747\" width\"600\" height=\"248\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 2256 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek 2256 Magnetic Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Bottom Diameter: 1.580\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Top Diameter: .750\"</li>\r\n<li>Receptor Diameter: 1.750\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
